#: ../../source/extending/contributing.rst:5
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter is a community driven project and accepts contributions of code "
"and documentation from the community. These contributions are made in the "
"form of Issues or `Pull Requests "
"<https://help.github.com/en/github/collaborating-with-issues-and-pull-"
"requests/about-pull-requests>`_ on the `CodeIgniter4 repository "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4>`_ on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter는 커뮤니티 주도 프로젝트로, 커뮤니티로부터 코드 및 문서 기여를 받습니다. 이러한 기여는 GitHub의 "
"`CodeIgniter4 저장소 <https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4>`_\\ 에 "
"Issues 또는 `Pull Requests <https://help.github.com/en/github/collaborating-"
"with-issues-and-pull-requests/about-pull-requests>`_\\ 의 형태로 이루어집니다."

#: ../../source/extending/contributing.rst:10
msgid ""
"If you'd like to contribute, please see the `Contributing to CodeIgniter4 "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/tree/develop/contributing>`_ "
"section of our code repository."
msgstr ""
"기여하고 싶다면 코드 저장소의 `Contributing to CodeIgniter4 "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/tree/develop/contributing>`_ "
"섹션을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/extending/core_classes.rst:3
msgid "Creating Core System Classes"
msgstr "코어 시스템 클래스 만들기"

#: ../../source/extending/core_classes.rst:5
msgid ""
"Every time CodeIgniter runs there are several base classes that are "
"initialized automatically as part of the core framework. It is possible, "
"however, to swap any of the core system classes with your own version or "
"even just extend the core versions."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter가 실행될 때마다 코어 프레임워크의 일부로 자동으로 초기화되는 여러 베이스 클래스가 있습니다. 하지만 코어 시스템 "
"클래스 중 어떤 것이든 자신만의 버전으로 교체하거나 코어 버전을 확장하는 것도 가능합니다."

#: ../../source/extending/core_classes.rst:9
msgid ""
"**Most users will never have any need to do this, but the option to replace "
"or extend them does exist for those who would like to significantly alter "
"the CodeIgniter core.**"
msgstr ""
"**대부분의 사용자는 이 작업을 할 필요가 없지만, CodeIgniter 코어를 크게 수정하려는 사람들을 위해 교체하거나 확장하는 옵션이"
" 존재합니다.**"

